opam-version: "2.0"
version: "0.1.0"
synopsis: "Faial: Rocq formalizations of GPU kernel analyses"
description:
  "Rocq formalizations of memory access pattern (MAP) analyses for GPU kernels: the Drf theory covers barrier alignment, phase-splitting and sequentialization of a ULang/WLang/ALang/TLang hierarchy; the Approx theory covers the approximation analysis with control-flow and data-independence judgments, dependency analysis, and soundness wrt true data-races."
